  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s specific development objective is to improve monitoring and evaluation frameworkscomma capacitycomma and use in supported developing countries in the French Speaking (Francophone) African Countries. In doing socomma the project will seek to build partnerships with existing ECD providers to generate synergies. This project aims to contribute to the higher-level development of objective of the GEIcomma namelycomma to improve monitoring and evaluation frameworkscomma capacitycomma and use in supported developing countries for improved evidence-informed policy making.</narrative>
  </description>
